id: parasite-drained-critical
name: Parasite-Drained (Critical)
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: Parasitic Biology (5)'s, for the Critical Health Threshold - its penalties' while they hold, for the
# Combat Encounter.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Parasitic Biology: Combat Rolls 1(bT) and Stress Bonus 1 lower while the Critical Health Threshold's penalties are suffered.
text: >
  Parasitic Biology (5): If you knock your Inferior through a Health Threshold with an Attacking Maneuver, and they fail the Steadfast Check for that Health Threshold, reduce their Combat Rolls by 1(bT) and their Stress Bonus by 1 while they suffer the Health Threshold Penalties for that Health Threshold.

---

[passive]
if (penalizedBy("critical")) {
  combatRolls -= 1(bT);
  stressBonus -= 1;
}
